<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Pulte said raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Pulte said raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney raised its rating of Pulte Corp to an accumulate from its prior rating of neutral, according to a source at Smith Barney.</p>
<p>-- Shares of the company, which builds single family homes and condos, rose 3/8 to 28-1/4 in early trading on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
